.DS_Store

# Harness signal file. Written by /to-preprod to trigger the auto-merge
# workflow, force-added onto the claude/ branch, and stripped from
# feature/<name> by the workflow's own cleanup before the PR merges.
# It must never reach preprod or main.
.pr-description.md

# The spec loop's coverage artifact, written by check:spec on every run that
# reaches evaluation. It is derived from the tree and a live read of the
# specification, and a committed copy would be the second copy the anchor
# convention exists to prevent. `.harness/gate-runs/` is the opposite case and
# is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the ledger that must reach preprod.
.harness/spec-coverage.json
